<title>POLAND: Farm Food to list 0.6 mln shrs Aug 11.</title>
<headline>Farm Food to list 0.6 mln shrs Aug 11.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse will add 600,000 shares  in meat processing firm Farm Food SA to the 2.9 million already trading  on August 11, bourse deputy president Ryszard Czerniawski told reporters  on Friday.</p>
<p>The shares are from a rights issue earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
